  "title": "Fury Appoints Senior Director, Environment and Permits - Fury Gold Mines Limited",
  "summary": "TORONTO, Canada – May 12, 2026 – Fury Gold Mines Limited (TSX and NYSE American: FURY) (“Fury” or the “Company”) is pleased to announce the appointment of Annie Blier, as Senior Director, Environment and Permits, who will lead the environmental strategy, technical studies, and permitting roadmap required to advance the Eau Claire high-grade gold project (“Eau Claire” or the “Project”) […]",
